    {
      "id": "vault",
      "in": 0.0,
      "out": 3.5,
      "action": "Inside the bite of a giant stone C: a blade of low sun sweeps the curved inner vault; a slice of golden court is framed by the letter's mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "exit",
      "in": 3.5,
      "out": 8.0,
      "action": "The camera exits through the mouth of the C \u2014 the reveal that we were inside a letter \u2014 and the standing word appears across the court, shadows raking toward the lens."
    },
    {
      "id": "colonnade",
      "in": 8.0,
      "out": 17.0,
      "action": "A lateral walk behind a colonnade: piers sweep the near field and occlude the monuments; shadow edges crawl across the inscribed floor."
    },
    {
      "id": "dial",
      "in": 17.0,
      "out": 26.0,
      "action": "Low oblique past the gnomon I: its long shadow tip sweeps the dial stations \u2014 point, line, form, world \u2014 each crossing ticked in the score."
    },
    {
      "id": "rise",
      "in": 26.0,
      "out": 34.0,
      "action": "Crane up and back: the court reads as an instrument; the shadow tip lands on the terminus inscription and the sentence completes \u2014 ideas, in motion."
    },
    {
      "id": "still",
      "in": 34.0,
      "out": 42.0,
      "action": "High golden three-quarter of the word keeping time; the sun settles, the haze breathes, the frame holds."
    }
  ],
